{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04196","headline":"秋日送侯四得弹字 · 骆宾王","name":"秋日送侯四得弹字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我留安豹隐，君去学鹏抟。\n岐路分襟易，风云促膝难。\n夕涨流波急，秋山落日寒。\n惟有思归引，凄断爲君弹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04196.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04196","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}